find
Usage: find [-HL] [PATH]... [OPTIONS] [ACTIONS]

Search for files and perform actions on them.
First failed action stops processing of current file.
Defaults: PATH is current directory, action is '-print'

	-L,-follow	Follow symlinks
	-H		...on command line only
	-xdev		Don't cross mounts
	-maxdepth N	At most N levels
			-maxdepth 0 applies actions to command line args only
	-mindepth N	At least N levels
	-depth		Contents before dir

Actions:
	( ACTIONS )	Group actions for -o / -a
	! ACT		Invert ACT's success/failure
	ACT1 [-a] ACT2	If ACT1 fails, stop, else do ACT2
	ACT1 -o ACT2	Match either action
			Note: -a has higher priority than -o
	-name PATTERN	Filename matches
	-iname PATTERN	-name, any case
	-path PATTERN	Match path to PATTERN
	-ipath PATTERN	Case insensitive -path
	-regex PATTERN	Match path to regex PATTERN
	-type X		One of f,d,l,b,c,s,p
	-executable	File is executable
	-perm MASK	Mode bits match
			(+MASK any bit, -MASK all bits, MASK exact)
	-mtime DAYS	Modified DAYS ago
			(+N earlier, -N more recent, N exact)
	-atime DAYS	atime +N/-N/N days in the past
	-ctime DAYS	ctime +N/-N/N days in the past
	-mmin MINS	Modified MINS ago
			(+N earlier, -N more recent, N exact)
	-amin MINS	atime +N/-N/N minutes in the past
	-cmin MINS	ctime +N/-N/N minutes in the past
	-newer FILE	mtime is more recent than FILE's
	-inum N		File has inode number N
	-samefile FILE	File is same as FILE
	-user NAME/ID	Owned by user
	-group NAME/ID	Owned by group
	-size N[bck]	Size N (+more -less)
			c:bytes, k:kbytes, b:512 bytes (default)
	-links N	Number of links is greater than (+N), less than (-N),
			or exactly N
	-empty		Empty file or dir
	-prune		Don't enter this dir
If none of the following actions is specified, -print is assumed
	-print		Print file name
	-print0		Names ended by NUL
	-exec CMD ARG ;	Run CMD per file
			(fails if CMD exits with nonzero)
	-exec CMD ARG + One CMD, all files
	-ok CMD ARG ;   Prompt and run CMD with {} replaced
	-delete		Delete current file/directory. Turns on -depth option
	-quit		Stop at first match
